SUMMARY:Upstairs at Helium: New Year's Eve with Rob Ward
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 10 W. Georgia St.\, Indianapolis
DESCRIPTION:Comedian Rob Ward is becoming one of the most booked comics fro
 m the MidWest. Rob began his career in stand up in 2010\, in his hometown o
 f Cleveland\, Oh. at an open mic. Rob did such a great job that he was aske
 d to become the house emcee for that same open mic\, just three weeks later
 .\n\nSince then\, Rob has had an abundance of success and recognition as he
  continues to rise in his field. Some of the places that Rob has had the pl
 easure of appearing include\, but are not limited to: Comedy Central Presen
 ts Kevin Hart's "Hart of the City" Season 3\, The Bill Cunningham Show on t
 he CW network\, and he was also a winner at the World Famous "Showtime at t
 he Apollo" Theatre in Harlem New York.\n\nSome of Rob's recognition and awa
 rds include but are not limited to\; touring with national touring headline
 r Benji Brown on his “pull up and laugh tour” he also joined the Alan c
 ox tour in 2019. In addition Rob was also the runner up for the "Shaq All-S
 tar Comedy Jam\," Cleveland competition\, as well as recently being named "
 The Comedian of the Year\," in the Ohio Urban Comedy awards.\n\nRob credits
  his inspiration to God\, His Wife\, his two beautiful daughters\, his mom\
 , family\, and his supporters.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: our Upstairs showroom is 21+
  and is NOT wheelchair accessible.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prev
 ent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or danger
 ous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/even
 t/upstairs-at-helium-new-year-s-eve-with-rob-ward/
